The '''Voidling Extremist''' is a neutral [[Mob]] that spawns in [[Void Sepulture]], within [[The End]]. 

== Behavior ==
Similar to normal [[Endermen]], it won't attack players unless the player provokes it by hitting it or looks straight into its eyes.

